  "about_section": {
    "title": "ABOUT CHENMING",
    "layout": [
      {
        "html": "<div contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"padding:40px; font-size:1.1rem; line-height:1.8; font-weight:300; max-width:600px; outline:none;\"><p data-path-to-node=\"2\" style=\"font-size: 17.6px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(31, 31, 31); font-family: &quot;Google Sans Flex&quot;, &quot;Google Sans&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-variant-ligatures: none; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><b>Li Chenming</b>&nbsp;is an Architectural Designer and Researcher based in Hong Kong and Shen Zhen. He holds a Master of Architecture from&nbsp;<b>The University of Hong Kong (HKU)</b>.&nbsp;His professional experience encompasses a diverse range of scales and typologies, from large-scale public institutions like the Wuxi Urban Construction Museum to educational facilities such as the Guangzhou Huawai International School.&nbsp;Prior to his current role, he contributed to the development of several international school projects in Shenzhen and Wuhan during his tenure at ZHUBO Design Group.</span></p><p data-path-to-node=\"2\" style=\"font-size: 17.6px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(31, 31, 31); font-family: &quot;Google Sans Flex&quot;, &quot;Google Sans&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-variant-ligatures: none; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">In addition to his design practice, Chenming is deeply engaged in computational research, specifically exploring the intersection of<b>&nbsp;Artificial Intelligence&nbsp;</b>and architectural production.&nbsp;While serving as a Research Assistant at HKU's Department of Architecture, he focused on the strategic integration of text-to-image generation and evolutionary computing within multiplayer design processes.&nbsp;His research has been published in recognized international platforms, including<b>&nbsp;ACADIA 2023&nbsp;</b>and&nbsp;<b>Design Computation Input/Output</b>.&nbsp;His work has received several accolades, including the<b>&nbsp;Asian Design Award</b>&nbsp;and the Anji International Bamboo Construction Competition award.</span></p></div>",
